# proto-file: protowire/schema/catalog/v1/catalog.proto
# proto-message: protowire.schema.catalog.v1.Catalog
#
# The pinned conformance catalog for this fixture, in the §7 catalog
# source format (issue #194): a text-format Catalog message, one locale
# per file, entries keyed by violation code with {param} templates.
# Target for catalog-loader implementations: loading this file and
# registering it yields the "de" rendering pinned in messages_de.txt.
# There is deliberately no entry for "profile.display_name.length" —
# that miss is the fixture's point.

locale: "de"
entries {
  key: "profile.username.format"
  value: "Benutzername muss dem Muster {pattern} entsprechen"
}
